## 3. Architecture Compatibility Matrix

Glm5Next vs Colibri Engines:

  Feature              | GLM-5.3-Flash (Glm5Next) | Colibri glm_moe_dsa | Colibri deepseek_v4
  ---------------------|--------------------------|---------------------|------------------
  MoE with shared exp. | YES (288 routed + 1 shared) | YES (64 experts)   | YES
  Expert routing       | sigmoid top-8            | ?                   | ?
  Attention            | MLA + deepseek_sparse     | standard            | MLA-like?
  Layer 45 (MTP)       | YES (enorm/hnorm)         | MTP row present     | ?
  Tensor naming        | model.language_model.*    | model.*             | model.*
  Quantization         | e4m3 (experts only)       | int4/int8 supported | int4/int8 supp.

⚠️  Colibri binary has deepseek_v4 engine slot but NO symbols in current binary.
⚠️  glm_moe_dsa is present and linked — but may not handle MLA/288-expert routing.

